@startuml
title AgriDrone v3 - Settlement-gated atomic release (target)
actor SystemManager as M
actor TenantOwner as O
participant "Review / payment handlers (.NET)" as H
participant "Release coordinator (.NET)" as R
database "PostgreSQL business / audit / Outbox" as DB
participant "Gateway webhook" as G
participant "Async delivery / projections" as C
M -> H: Approve exact reviewed revision
H -> DB: Store frozen approval / ApprovedAt
H -> R: Evaluate release
R -> DB: Check current approval, finalized invoice and receipts
alt RemainingDue > 0
  R --> H: ApprovedAwaitingSettlement
  O -> G: Pay server-issued balance obligation
  G -> H: Authenticated / deduplicated confirmation
  H -> DB: Persist receipt / allocations
  H -> R: Evaluate release again
else RemainingDue = 0
  note over R: Overpayment obligation does not block release
end
group One transaction - locking and idempotent receipt
  R -> DB: Lock and recheck result / invoice / payment / authorization
  alt Exact revision valid and no remaining amount
    R -> DB: Immutable publication / visibility unlock
    R -> DB: Durable in-app notice + revision claim deadline
    R -> DB: Original service value once / completion / audit / Outbox
    R -> DB: Commit; PublishedAt = UnlockedAt = NoticeCreatedAt
  else Stale / invalid / failed write
    R -> DB: Roll back entire release
  end
end
DB --> C: Outbox delivery after commit
C -> DB: Idempotent projection / delivery receipt
note over C: Email retries do not create or reset claim window
O -> H: Read released result / history
H -> DB: Ownership + released source + not withdrawn
H --> O: Exact allowed version and calendar deadline
note over R,DB: Concurrent approval/payment triggers produce one release receipt
@enduml
